1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Crumbling Memory-Archway, tense.

2
00:00:04,300 --> 00:00:06,300
Lyra: Not this one. Never this one!

3
00:00:06,600 --> 00:00:08,600
Echo Shard: Release it. Peace awaits.

4
00:00:08,900 --> 00:00:09,900
Lyra: Get off me!

5
00:00:10,200 --> 00:00:11,200
Echo Shard: Pointless struggle.

6
00:00:12,500 --> 00:00:16,500
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Fractured Memory-Bridge, urgent.

7
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:17,800
Lyra: Almost... got it!

8
00:00:18,100 --> 00:00:20,100
Kael: Don't... fall. Not again.

9
00:00:20,400 --> 00:00:21,400
Lyra: Kael? Is that...?

10
00:00:21,700 --> 00:00:22,700
Echo Shard: Distraction is weakness.

11
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:28,000
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Dissolving Memory-Plaza, dread.

12
00:00:28,300 --> 00:00:29,300
Lyra: This way! Move!

13
00:00:29,600 --> 00:00:31,600
Loom of Oblivion: Let it return. To us.

14
00:00:31,900 --> 00:00:32,900
Lyra: Never! It's mine!

15
00:00:33,200 --> 00:00:34,200
Loom of Oblivion: You are... ours.

16
00:00:35,500 --> 00:00:38,500
♪ at dawn, in Fragmented Skyline City, tense.

17
00:00:38,800 --> 00:00:39,800
Lyra: Unstable. Everything's unstable.

18
00:00:40,100 --> 00:00:42,100
Kael: The edges... always betray.

19
00:00:42,400 --> 00:00:43,400
Lyra: Just... hold. Please.

20
00:00:43,700 --> 00:00:45,700
Loom of Oblivion: The city... remembers nothing.

21
00:00:46,1000 --> 00:00:49,1000
♪ in broad daylight, in Whispering Memory-Market, urgent.

22
00:00:50,300 --> 00:00:52,300
Lyra: This shard... a path?

23
00:00:52,600 --> 00:00:54,600
Kael: He waited. For you.

24
00:00:54,900 --> 00:00:55,900
Lyra: Who? Where?

25
00:00:56,200 --> 00:00:57,200
Loom of Oblivion: False hope. Surrender.

26
00:00:58,500 --> 00:01:01,500
♪ in broad daylight, in Collapsing Memory-Library, dread.

27
00:01:01,800 --> 00:01:03,800
Loom of Oblivion: Why retain this pain?

28
00:01:04,100 --> 00:01:06,100
Lyra: It's not pain! It's me!

29
00:01:06,400 --> 00:01:08,400
Loom of Oblivion: A burden. We offer peace.

30
00:01:08,700 --> 00:01:10,700
Lyra: Your peace is oblivion!

31
00:01:11,1000 --> 00:01:13,1000
♪ at dusk, in Shifting Memory-Garden, tense.

32
00:01:14,300 --> 00:01:16,300
Lyra: How do I use them?

33
00:01:16,600 --> 00:01:18,600
Kael: To spend... is to lose.

34
00:01:18,900 --> 00:01:20,900
Lyra: But... I can't keep running!

35
00:01:21,200 --> 00:01:23,200
Kael: Hold them close. They are you.

36
00:01:24,500 --> 00:01:26,500
♪ at dusk, in Memory-Maze Alleyways, desperate.

37
00:01:26,800 --> 00:01:27,800
Lyra: Dead end! No!

38
00:01:28,100 --> 00:01:30,100
Loom of Oblivion: The path ends here.

39
00:01:30,400 --> 00:01:32,400
Lyra: There has to be... something!

40
00:01:32,700 --> 00:01:34,700
Loom of Oblivion: No escape. Only peace.

41
00:01:35,1000 --> 00:01:40,1000
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Edge of the Memory Chasm, dread.

42
00:01:41,300 --> 00:01:43,300
Lyra: This is it. The end.

43
00:01:43,600 --> 00:01:45,600
Loom of Oblivion: Your memories... return home.

44
00:01:45,900 --> 00:01:47,900
Lyra: Not without a fight!

45
00:01:48,200 --> 00:01:50,200
Loom of Oblivion: Futile. You are exhausted.

46
00:01:51,500 --> 00:01:55,500
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Memory Chasm Precipice, urgent.

47
00:01:55,800 --> 00:01:57,800
Lyra: Forgive me. For this.

48
00:01:58,100 --> 00:02:00,100
Kael: No! Not that one!

49
00:02:00,400 --> 00:02:02,400
Lyra: I have to! To live!

50
00:02:02,700 --> 00:02:04,700
Loom of Oblivion: A sacrifice. We observe.

51
00:02:05,1000 --> 00:02:09,1000
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Across the Memory Chasm, desperate.

52
00:02:10,300 --> 00:02:11,300
Lyra: Gone. It's gone.

53
00:02:11,600 --> 00:02:13,600
Kael: They know... your path.

54
00:02:13,900 --> 00:02:16,900
Loom of Oblivion: A memory shared... is a memory understood.

55
00:02:17,200 --> 00:02:18,200
Lyra: They know... everything.
